WEBVTT

00:00:00.649 --> 00:00:01.317
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.362 --> 00:00:03.647
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you like school?

00:00:04.558 --> 00:00:08.908
<v><b>S1:</b></v> I didn’t hate school, but I don’t think I liked it very much.

00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:18.228
I used to enjoy PE, I used to enjoy sport, um, I quite liked English, but there were lots of subjects I didn’t like.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:24.692
I didn’t like maths very much, history was boring, and I found science difficult.

00:00:25.687 --> 00:00:30.669
I had a small group of friends – not many, but a close group of friends –

00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:35.960
and I used to spend time with them talking about sport, talking about music.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:40.268
So it wasn’t too bad, but I didn’t like it very much.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.427
I’ve never been back to school – I’ve never been to a school reunion, or anything like that.

00:00:47.522 --> 00:00:48.139
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:49.206 --> 00:00:50.668
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you like school?

00:00:51.094 --> 00:00:52.560
<v><b>S2:</b></v> No, not really.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.099
I didn’t like it at all.

00:00:54.422 --> 00:00:55.385
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Why not?

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:59.879
<v><b>S2:</b></v> It was a boys’ school and I got bored with just being with boys all the time.

00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:02.460
And I didn’t really like any of the subjects.

00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:05.428
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.810
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you like school?

00:01:08.257 --> 00:01:10.555
<v><b>S3:</b></v> Well, yes and no.

00:01:11.027 --> 00:01:15.905
Some things I really loved, some things I thought, ‘this isn’t much fun’,

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.551
but I used to enjoy quite a lot of the subjects.

00:01:19.999 --> 00:01:20.835
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Like what?

00:01:21.588 --> 00:01:24.192
<v><b>S3:</b></v> I liked English and I liked maths.

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.125
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> And what didn’t you enjoy?

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.066
<v><b>S3:</b></v> I hated geography.

00:01:28.594 --> 00:01:30.010
And I hated PE.

00:01:30.794 --> 00:01:35.544
The PE teacher once caught me reading a book on the football pitch, and I was punished for that.

00:01:37.566 --> 00:01:38.284
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:39.294 --> 00:01:40.397
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you like school?

00:01:40.859 --> 00:01:47.497
<v><b>S4:</b></v> I didn’t like it – I absolutely loved it! I liked all the subjects, especially English and history.

00:01:48.038 --> 00:01:55.261
I remember one time when I was about six or seven, I got ill during the Easter holidays and I was really, really sad,

00:01:55.555 --> 00:01:59.085
and my mum thought I was sad because I was ill during the holidays,

00:01:59.086 --> 00:02:05.090
but in fact I was terrified that I’d never get better and I’d never go back to school.

00:02:07.146 --> 00:02:07.931
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:02:08.976 --> 00:02:10.240
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you like school?

00:02:10.782 --> 00:02:12.696
<v><b>S5:</b></v> Er, sometimes.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.121
Yeah, most of the time.

00:02:15.453 --> 00:02:17.019
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What did you like about it?

00:02:17.416 --> 00:02:21.909
<v><b>S5:</b></v> Well, I had some good friends, and I liked learning things,

00:02:22.376 --> 00:02:27.782
but there were some subjects that I didn’t like very much and I hated PE.

00:02:28.318 --> 00:02:34.799
I used to invent a lot of excuses, like saying that I was ill, because I didn’t want to do it.

00:02:36.922 --> 00:02:37.731
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:02:38.729 --> 00:02:39.885
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you like school?

00:02:40.398 --> 00:02:46.552
<v><b>S6:</b></v> Yes, overall, I really enjoyed school, though there were some things I didn’t like.

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:47.667
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Like what?

00:02:48.082 --> 00:02:53.063
<v><b>S6:</b></v> In English I found reading long texts very hard, as I have dyslexia,

00:02:53.464 --> 00:02:57.526
and because of this my handwriting was also slow and messy.

00:02:58.021 --> 00:03:03.348
And I struggle with numbers too, so maths and physics were very difficult for me.

00:03:03.815 --> 00:03:05.559
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What things did you like?

00:03:05.807 --> 00:03:09.796
<v><b>S6:</b></v> Um, I discovered I was interested in history,

00:03:09.861 --> 00:03:14.538
because my teachers were passionate about what they taught, which made me want to learn.

00:03:15.024 --> 00:03:18.352
But I enjoyed visual and active learning much more,

00:03:18.616 --> 00:03:23.827
so subjects like drama, art and cooking were some of my favourites.